  "findings": [
    "uv 0.8.17 Cargo.lock pins reqwest 0.12.22, hyper-util 0.1.16 and system-configuration 0.6.1.",
    "uv constructs the HTTP client before applying offline middleware.",
    "reqwest system matcher invokes hyper-util Matcher::from_system.",
    "hyper-util mac::with_system calls SCDynamicStoreBuilder::build unconditionally before examining proxy environment values; HTTP_PROXY, HTTPS_PROXY and NO_PROXY cannot prevent that call.",
    "No compatible original wheel archives for the locked dependency set or uv were found in the known uv cache; the pip cache paths do not exist.",
    "PyArrow 25.0.1 has no cache artifact in the known wheel cache; the previous working-environment fallback came from a verified installed package, not a wheel archive.",
    "Known executable paths expose only uv 0.8.17; no separate network-capable standard execution tool was available."
  ],
